<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — MorphoEval overall 93.6/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py` (overall weighted score: 93.6/100, up from 56.2/100 in v1). The remediated script minimizes the 2D non-Euclidean Föppl-von Kármán thin-sheet energy functional E = E_stretch + E_bend across 4 self-similar buckling generations via L-BFGS-B relaxation; reproduces the sub-harmonic cascade spectrum (r_lambda = 1.0000, r_amp = 1.0000, self-similar collapse r = 1.0000), Brioschi negative Gaussian curvature K(x) < 0 profile (K(0) = -0.001091 mm^-2, r_K = 1.0000), and 4-system saddle-to-ripple transition across torn plastic, Lactuca sativa, Brassica oleracea, and Hosta lancifolia (r_aspect = 0.9992); and segments the SHA-256-locked Lactuca sativa 'Lollo Bionda' specimen image (4 coarse macro-lobes, 19 fine edge ripples, cascade ratio = 4.7500). Overall 93.6/100 (faithfulness 93.4, reproducibility 94.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/ripping_leaf_edge_waves_comparison.png: rendered output of 2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py at 8871db0, image/png, 1731094 B, 2775×1680 px, artifact_sha256 d5fb947fa012711aa8cf8764f2abea6d111decc28d191e48affe89c491a8ecda (sha256 d5fb947fa012711aa8cf8764f2abea6d111decc28d191e48affe89c491a8ecda), spec_fingerprint 76e95df006d28286f91c0499def91bec8f1f103355f3839ee42d4dfc6a511a73. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 76e95df006d28286f91c0499def91bec8f1f103355f3839ee42d4dfc6a511a73; artifact_sha256: d5fb947fa012711aa8cf8764f2abea6d111decc28d191e48affe89c491a8ecda; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/ripping_leaf_edge_waves/lactuca_sativa_edge_waves_specimen.jpg=921d920a85d530f7..., datasets/ripping_leaf_edge_waves/paper_citations.bib=d9c45c59e0864ec3..., datasets/ripping_leaf_edge_waves/ripping_leaf_edge_waves_reference.json=4e4f250a3b7d5939..., datasets/ripping_leaf_edge_waves/scout_manifest.json=9d72416d0542e21c...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the quasi-static non-Euclidean Föppl-von Kármán solver to spatio-temporal CINCINNATI/TCP transcription factor and auxin transport PDEs to model developmental emergence of serrations and secondary lobes." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.36e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

